# Sounds Directory

Place your audio assets here:
- Notification sounds
- UI interaction sounds
- Background music
- Alert tones
- Voice recordings

## Recommended Structure
- `/notifications/` - Alert and notification sounds
- `/ui/` - Button clicks, hovers, interactions
- `/alerts/` - Warning and error sounds
- `/music/` - Background music files

## Supported Formats
- MP3 (best browser support)
- WAV (high quality)
- OGG (open format)
- M4A (Apple devices)

## Usage in Blade
```blade
<audio id="notification">
    <source src="{{ asset('assets/sounds/notification.mp3') }}" type="audio/mpeg">
    <source src="{{ asset('assets/sounds/notification.ogg') }}" type="audio/ogg">
</audio>
```

## Usage in JavaScript
```javascript
const sound = new Audio('/assets/sounds/notification.mp3');
sound.play();
```

## Best Practices
- Keep file sizes small (compress audio)
- Provide multiple formats for compatibility
- Use descriptive filenames
- Limit background music volume
- Consider user preferences for sound effects
